## Data and third-party services

The Software processes board positions and move history in your browser. Settings and saved detection-game data are stored in your browser’s local storage; the project does not operate a server that receives this game data. The Software downloads Stockfish engine files from unpkg and may request fonts from Google Fonts. Those providers may receive ordinary request and device information when your browser fetches those resources, subject to their own terms and privacy policies.

